THIRD-PARTY NOTICES

This project integrates gameplay designs and data from the following
open-source projects. Their licenses apply to the referenced material:

1. Ayrton09/AstraSkins (MIT License)
   - web/data/*.json (weapon/knife/glove/agent/sticker/keychain/music catalog data)
   - Econ attribute application approach (ported/reimplemented)

2. Nereziel/cs2-WeaponPaints (GPL-3.0)
   - Preview images referenced by URL from its website/img CDN (not redistributed here)
   - Item attribute injection mechanism (reimplemented against the same gamedata signature)

3. LielXD/CS2-WeaponPaints-Website (see upstream repository for license)
   - Icon manifest lists used to build web/data/icon-map.json (fetched by tools/update-catalog.cjs)

4. shobhit-pathak/MatchZy (GPL-3.0)
   - Competitive match flow concepts (ready system, knife round) - reimplemented, no code copied

5. NockyCZ/CS2-Deathmatch
   - Deathmatch feature set concepts (respawn, spawn protection, weapon menu) - reimplemented

Counter-Strike 2 and Steam are trademarks and property of Valve Corporation.
This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Valve.
